Pydantic Models

How this protects your API

1. Automatic Error Handling: If a user tries to send a request without a name, or sends an empty string "", FastAPI will automatically intercept the request and return a clear 422 Unprocessable Entity status code explaining exactly what went wrong. Your database will never see the bad data.
2. Interactive Clean Docs: If you reload your browser and open http://127.0.0, you will see that the POST /items/ route no longer expects data through URL query strings. Instead, it features an interactive Request Body JSON box displaying your exact data model guidelines.